        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "49f42cc4-b1d8-5f23-b286-f80c70e413e6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christian Whitehead, Tyson Hesse\n- Products: Sonic Mania, Retro Engine\n- Companies: Sega, PagodaWest Games, Headcannon\n- Topics: Sonic the Hedgehog series\n\nFacts:\n- Christian Whitehead is most recognized for creating updated ports of early games in Sega's Sonic the Hedgehog series.\n- Retro Engine is a game engine developed by Australian programmer Christian Whitehead.\n- Retro Engine is best known for its use by Sega for games in the Sonic the Hedgehog series.\n- In 2017, Tyson Hesse led the creation of the animated cutscenes for the platform game Sonic Mania.\n- Christian Whitehead was the project lead of the original Sonic the Hedgehog series title Sonic Mania.\n- Sonic Mania is a side-scrolling platform game developed by PagodaWest Games and Headcannon and published by Sega.\n- Sonic Mania was released for Nintendo Switch, PlayStation 4, Xbox One, and Microsoft Windows.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
